    "body": "We used an offline VM running a copy of our Agie Classic Cut 2S machine control. We checked both left and right straight cutoffs. The control plotted one stock crossing per pass, with four alternating passes and both endpoints in air. The traces showed no additional cutting move through the stock.\n\nAll controller runs were offline. No physical cut was made.\n",
